\title{[DP2] Consulting recurrence (1 pt)}
\date{2026-10-27T21:38:46Z}
\tag{algorithms}
\tag{problem}

\import{algorithms-macros}

\p{Let #{C(i,c)} denote the minimum cost possible if you operate your business for only months #{1} through #{i} \strong{and end in city #{c}}.  For example, #{C(3,\sf{NY})} denotes the minimum possible cost for the first three months (disregarding any following months) that end by operating out of New York in month 3.}

\p{Define #{C} via a recurrence.}
